`, `set()`, `delete()`, and `clear()` methods, plus automatic key generation and TTL support.\n\n**Database Layer** (`src/database.js`): Promise-based SQLite wrapper with `users` and `posts` tables.\n\n**API Server** (`src/server.js`): Express server with 5 cached endpoints:\n- `GET /users` (cache 5 min)\n- `GET /users/:id` (cache 5 min)  \n- `GET /users/:id/posts` (cache 10 min)\n- `POST /users` and `POST /users/:id/posts` (with cache invalidation)\n\n## Key features:\n\n- Hierarchical cache keys (`users:all`, `posts:user:1`)\n- Automatic cache invalidation on writes\n- Responses show `cached: true/false` for transparency\n- Graceful fallback to DB on cache misses\n- Error handling throughout\n\nTo use: `npm install` then `npm start` (requires Redis on localhost:6379).","ttft_ms":2243,"type":"result","duration_ms":51037,"uuid":"4a90da7a-4ba7-43d2-8144-b3c990c264be","ttft_stream_ms":802,"time_to_request_ms":61,"first_content_frame_ms":803,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
